"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:10052","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c439","characterName":"友永和樹","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c439"},"originalCharacterName":"友永和樹","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A robot whose mission is to collect data regarding human emotions and report them back to his superior for \"Global Illumination\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The center of everything that Hello, world boils down to is –not surprisingly– Kazuki, the protagonist. His mission leads him to start off this journey, from the initial boot sequence which will excite any computer programmer, and computer-oriented thought sequence, to the endpoint where his observation subjects become people he willingly desires to protect despite his logic circuit."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The excruciating details of everyday life between the regular student life and the robotic reports to \"HIKARI\" will, through the meticulous writing of Shikashi, the writer, seep the subtle changes of Kazuki personifying through tiny things like the time he takes to respond vocally to others, his speech patterns becoming less formal and various neat tid-bits that one can pick up when reading."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from a review by Warum"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c439"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b74e757bb664ee6d783cb1deba37d8098a10847dadeedebf46c563feee68247f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f23da5acde4d167081118f1f20786e6851ca382f9acc299443b2ddacfda442a4.webp","width":256,"height":236,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c443","characterName":"ハルカ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c443"},"originalCharacterName":"ハルカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first a robot shop's companion/guide robot that does nothing but introduces pet robots to customers, but later gets rebuilt by Mika and Kazuki with the self-thinking AI. She expresses many human emotion thanks to Kazuki’s base data and opts to be his imouto."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Side note, Haruka’s got to be the most moe character in the heroine group."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from a review by Warum"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c443"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d045948dd285758d16cf0656bc8a65093007c83300053869c6770185f9a94cdb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f679ebcbcd51b858b2bf868e4dc5faf70d6bc50dc199d51d8c6f8187d7b9509b.webp","width":256,"height":236,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"栗林 みな実","creatorId":"vndb:s18","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s18","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18","name":"栗林 みな実","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:4431","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c445","characterName":"帯刀","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c445"},"originalCharacterName":"帯刀","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chieri's butler and pilot."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c445"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/0235b003910346560c460f304546730307c68782f12bf6a954684ac51e716322.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/8803b7f601526c8b82975a76e37e8b916fd4ec506db9a97efd17206591ffb51f.webp","width":256,"height":236,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c446","characterName":"麻生 純子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c446"},"originalCharacterName":"麻生 純子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The mysterious figure that had been observing Kazuki from afar ever since the power-out in school in the beginning. What could she possibly be up to?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's actually"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"a police officer belonging to the Tokyo Metropolitan Police's Counter-Cyberterrorism department, alias \"Cyberforce\". Her hair is a long immaculate silver ponytail, and she's an adult lady possessing both really strict, but at the same time a very gentle personality. She's quite adept at martial arts and at the usage of firearms."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from a review by Warum"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c446"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/40/40a72d7fda2b35f994e6d47b38aa5023f3553343fed005b97899b5474d975736.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fb1990092b1a823ed4159d35891ca798debd17e4112e2fd7cfa1c67168360213.webp","width":256,"height":236,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"七瀬 舞","creatorId":"vndb:s3710","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3710","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3710","name":"渡辺 美佐","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:4441","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c448","characterName":"久我山 深佳","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c448"},"originalCharacterName":"久我山 深佳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Classmate of Kazuki. A green haired, ponytailed girl with a short physique and childish face, which often makes her to be confused as a junior high schooler. Younger sister of Wakana, Mika is a prodigy that skipped grades in school. In particular, her forte lies in computer/robot hardwares. Albeit she's bright and energetic, her selfish behavior causes other people to look down on her, thus she don't have many friends. While she's a slow runner, she's good at ball games. Loves dancing, dislikes being treated like a child, and also dislikes carrots/peas."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from a review by Warum"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c448"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b79e81d157f874a87a90a07d94713fc6e0fe661b2a1b363bdd7505f786f0a086.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/aea4994eb8e0d06510a196840b837abe179af31814fd29dc56a6d1e8eaf26b60.webp","width":256,"height":236,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夏野 向日葵","creatorId":"vndb:s855","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s855","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s855","name":"瀬那 歩美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:4438","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c466","characterName":"愛原 奈都美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c466"},"originalCharacterName":"愛原 奈都美","characterNameSource":null,"